silm:instances_papers_03_silmaril_federation_chapters_07_knowledge_graph_cross_reference_sections_03_kg_colimit_leg_concrete_anchor_node1 silm:hasLongDescription "The KGColimitLegSourceNode is KGView_Mittens (colimit of KG sources). In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'Source (typed federation object)', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
